OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian struck by lorry in
OL,4,AInverness city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has been struck by a lorry
OL,7,Fin Inverness' Academy Street.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,Fcity centre at about 09:50.
OL,12,FPolice Scotland said the "serious
OL,13,Fcrash" had closed Academy Street and
OL,14,Fclosures were in place at Crown Road
OL,15,Fand Chapel Street's junction with
OL,16,FAcademy Street.
OL,18,FThe force said members of the public
OL,19,Fshould avoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
